# Workers

Vite workers: `import X from '../workers/….ts?worker'` then `new X()` (bundled file; avoids HTTP/1.1 pending on `?worker_file` ESM graphs). Typed `postMessage` unions live next to the worker.

| Worker | Hook | Job |
|--------|------|-----|
| `dictionary.worker.ts` | `useDictionaryWorker` | Prefix search on ImageKit `dictionary.txt` (2-letter buckets) |
| `prediction.worker.ts` | `usePredictionWorker` | Next-word / prefix from grammar rules, ImageKit ngrams, and personal graph |
| `agent.worker.ts` | `useAgentWorker` | Gemini harness; abort; host-tool round trip |

Fetch language assets on the main thread (`languageAssets.ts`), then `postMessage({ type: 'init' })` into the worker. Do not `fetch()` ImageKit from the worker (that hung the suggestion popover).
